{:frontmatter
 {:id "adr-2607092700-shinshi-inc-settlement-kotoba-lang-pay"
  :title "ADR-2607092700: club-shinshi/net-babiniku settlement operator = Shinshi Inc (JK株式会社), @etzhayyim/sdk payment surface re-homed as kotoba-lang/pay"
  :status "accepted"
  :doc_type "adr"
  :topic "shinshi-inc-settlement-kotoba-lang-pay"
  :authoritative true
  :last_verified "2026-07-09"
  :authoritative_for
  ["settlement/operating entity for club-shinshi and net-babiniku creator monetization
    (tip/subscribe/PPV) = JK株式会社 ('Shinshi Inc.', GitHub org jk-luxury) — etzhayyim is
    not involved and keeps its donation-only rail unchanged"
   "the payment surface of @etzhayyim/sdk (pay.ts: pay/payStream/splitDistribute/escrow)
    is re-homed as the vendor-neutral common library kotoba-lang/pay (pure .cljc, zero
    network I/O, zero key custody, PayRail protocol seam, unprovisioned-rail honest default,
    entitle = verify-before-honor)"
   "supersession of ADR-2607071000 Decision #1 (vendor consumes etzhayyim rail) and
    Decision #4 (vendor->etzhayyim crossover proposal); its lexicon shape, client-side
    signing, and verify-before-honor invariants are retained"]
  :related
  ["90-docs/adr/2607071000-net-babiniku-crypto-payment-rail-etzhayyim-consumption.md"
